      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been on the Persona ID verification website for the last 6 hours and despite my ID being taken via a 1-2 year old smartphone, clear as day, in broad daylight, in high-resolution quality, 5000x3000, the website simply did not work. I really don't know how a website's priority on security can fail to read text that anybody with vision could see as clear as it gets.\n\nThere needs to be an alternative website or another solution to this. If I can't get it to read my state ID or my driver's license, how can I even trust it to verify anything else? I can't make these things any bigger than they already are.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
